## output agent
~
# unified run output — ignore binary/heavy, track readable artifacts
# pkl  = serialized Python objects (RD-Agent checkpoint, resume state)
# pt   = PyTorch KV-cache tensors (binary, bisa ratusan MB)
# db   = SQLite KV index
# __session__ = legacy RD-Agent session dir (berisi pkl-pkl di atas)
backend/runs/**/*.pkl
backend/runs/**/*.pt
backend/runs/**/*.db
backend/runs/**/__session__/
# factor_values.csv = matrix (saham × hari × faktor), 10-50 MB, regeneratable
backend/runs/**/factor_values.csv
backend/latent_runs/
